face_detector.onnx and face_landmarks.onnx

These are Google MediaPipe's BlazeFace short-range face detector and Face Mesh
V2 landmark models, converted to ONNX. FaceGate runs them only to draw the
enrollment preview; they take no part in recognition or authentication.

